{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve never been on a vacation like this\u2015\u2015</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heading for an extravagant dinner, <strong>penguins collide in a knockout race. TAKEOFF! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27Faaast Penguin Highlights\ud83d\udcf7\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cbStrategic attacks are the key to survival! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/a1dac990a7a7f7ef8e33c7d0295a5ccd.avif?t=1770272785\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Close the gap using rivals or obstacles\u2026 Attack at the right moment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your attack succeeds, you\u2019ll fly forward and speed up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use attacks right after each other after successful hits, so find opportunities to keep chaining combos as much as you can! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cbRace at all kinds of resorts from all over the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0d93d092c200be779b78cb2223a9e7e.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0d93d092c200be779b78cb2223a9e7e.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0d93d092c200be779b78cb2223a9e7e.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From high-speed water slides and desert pyramids to exploring massive waterfalls in the jungle, or even up in the clouds\u2014you are invited to take a 10-minute tour of up to four courses from a variety of options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penguins are obsessed with these amazing and chaotic races! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27<strong>GAME SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25efIntuitive and exciting action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/988ef9d97f126b76abe999be0d66458b.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/988ef9d97f126b76abe999be0d66458b.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/988ef9d97f126b76abe999be0d66458b.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Become a boost master by attacking opponents! Skid past your rivals via shortcuts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Sardine Cans and turn the tide with the Ultimate Ride! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race has begun! Get hyped in chaotic races filled with challenging rivals and obstacles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25efSurvive the party in this knockout action race! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1930e98d3496e0a343996d343066bb62.avif?t=1770272785\" width=600 height=290 /></span>The four resort activities are elimination-style races to knock others out of the party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top points earner is our winner\u2014time to grab your win and maybe a mackerel on the way out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25efYou have a bit of time to spare. What will you do? I\u2019ll be on vacation with friends! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play alone? Dive in with friends? Or huddle a big group for a party? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cFaaast Penguin,\u201d you can enjoy any situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play, up to 4-player party play, and custom matches for up to 40 penguins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cross-platform compatibility, anyone can splash their way in! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27<strong>Abundant penguin customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1cd9d7435568c1aa9bd602af93ebef21.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1cd9d7435568c1aa9bd602af93ebef21.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1cd9d7435568c1aa9bd602af93ebef21.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Customize your outfits, Rides, Ultimate Rides, and emotes to stand out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some outfits even change based on your gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since performance isn't affected, why not enjoy your vacation in style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08Oh, yeah. The penguins are actually tobogganing on Rides\ud83d\udc27\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/9194f969f097f8ad7047aa8452f30d5f.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/9194f969f097f8ad7047aa8452f30d5f.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/9194f969f097f8ad7047aa8452f30d5f.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courses and skins are scheduled to be continually added each season!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling and chaotic knockout action racing and join the penguin vacation!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ultimate Vacation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/54ac5afd1bf319254ccd47d2b6c1d96ea649912e.jpg"},{"name":"Undefeated Penguin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/62471f37709a7c16962d434f1583cbc5d27dad51.jpg"},{"name":"Penguin Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/33319fd22f96bf994c3d166c5cff2362411b4b3c.jpg"},{"name":"A Regular on the Podium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/4db5c41ca2fbee28ae63cda8ea5d8b1c27004bea.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Racer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/75b31f4354827e3d95969d571282c58bc0d23420.jpg"},{"name":"Make Way for the Honorable Penguin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/1405cb96533014ac6535cdc2a02ab9187af27218.jpg"},{"name":"Sardine Can-Getter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/3ae74e3f93ae9fe74c0be7aabab80847fd51ebf6.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/e27f5c1ab4f59c5d5956bcecc5531856a99ff307.jpg"},{"name":"Don't Bite That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/48f1266f5b221087dfb802fea188bb89c3e8e6d1.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Slider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2590150/232a739e38dd72788b3df6172da3c08c563907ce.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2590150?t=1770272785","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770272785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/7a677aacf97ce96287faa3fcce40cef2f70f44f4/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_9.jpg?t=1770272785","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/7a677aacf97ce96287faa3fcce40cef2f70f44f4/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_9.jpg?t=1770272785","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve never been on a vacation like this\u2015\u2015</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heading for an extravagant dinner, <strong>penguins collide in a knockout race. TAKEOFF! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27Faaast Penguin Highlights\ud83d\udcf7\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cbStrategic attacks are the key to survival! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/a1dac990a7a7f7ef8e33c7d0295a5ccd.avif?t=1770272785\" width=600 height=338 /></span>Close the gap using rivals or obstacles\u2026 Attack at the right moment! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your attack succeeds, you\u2019ll fly forward and speed up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use attacks right after each other after successful hits, so find opportunities to keep chaining combos as much as you can! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25cbRace at all kinds of resorts from all over the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0d93d092c200be779b78cb2223a9e7e.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0d93d092c200be779b78cb2223a9e7e.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/f0d93d092c200be779b78cb2223a9e7e.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From high-speed water slides and desert pyramids to exploring massive waterfalls in the jungle, or even up in the clouds\u2014you are invited to take a 10-minute tour of up to four courses from a variety of options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penguins are obsessed with these amazing and chaotic races! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27<strong>GAME SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25efIntuitive and exciting action</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/988ef9d97f126b76abe999be0d66458b.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/988ef9d97f126b76abe999be0d66458b.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/988ef9d97f126b76abe999be0d66458b.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Become a boost master by attacking opponents! Skid past your rivals via shortcuts! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt Sardine Cans and turn the tide with the Ultimate Ride! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The race has begun! Get hyped in chaotic races filled with challenging rivals and obstacles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25efSurvive the party in this knockout action race! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1930e98d3496e0a343996d343066bb62.avif?t=1770272785\" width=600 height=290 /></span>The four resort activities are elimination-style races to knock others out of the party! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top points earner is our winner\u2014time to grab your win and maybe a mackerel on the way out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25efYou have a bit of time to spare. What will you do? I\u2019ll be on vacation with friends! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/78d566dab154116a372268b11b025292.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play alone? Dive in with friends? Or huddle a big group for a party? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In \u201cFaaast Penguin,\u201d you can enjoy any situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo play, up to 4-player party play, and custom matches for up to 40 penguins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cross-platform compatibility, anyone can splash their way in! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc27<strong>Abundant penguin customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1cd9d7435568c1aa9bd602af93ebef21.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1cd9d7435568c1aa9bd602af93ebef21.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/1cd9d7435568c1aa9bd602af93ebef21.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Customize your outfits, Rides, Ultimate Rides, and emotes to stand out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some outfits even change based on your gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since performance isn't affected, why not enjoy your vacation in style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\uff08Oh, yeah. The penguins are actually tobogganing on Rides\ud83d\udc27\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/9194f969f097f8ad7047aa8452f30d5f.poster.avif?t=1770272785\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/9194f969f097f8ad7047aa8452f30d5f.webm?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/extras/9194f969f097f8ad7047aa8452f30d5f.mp4?t=1770272785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Courses and skins are scheduled to be continually added each season!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling and chaotic knockout action racing and join the penguin vacation!</p>","developers":["historia Inc."],"dlc":[3678380],"ext_user_account_notice":"Epic Online Services ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590150/2f3483dcc9152a1e7b690b6458ab337a6f303dc2/header_alt_assets_9.jpg?t=1770272785","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9historia Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2590150/333433142/975640af7c8da21aebca69672e8040081c369e50/1770191080/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770272780","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstat